    "text": "Esa is a heroine of Irish myth. Her mother Etain is a woman from fairy stock who returned to life as a human. Her father is Eochaid Airem, the king of Tara. Her mother's first love, the fairy king, arrived out of the living world seeking to take Etain home. At that time Etain carried the child of Eochaid, and that child was Esa. Eochaid later married his own daughter by mistake. He was tricked into thinking Esa was Etain. The child of Esa and Eochaid lost her mind. That woman later became the queen named Mess Buachalla.",
